/target
/build
truman_ref/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# Module signing secrets (Ed25519 raw keys used by scripts/sign.py)
# NEVER commit private_key — required to sign GitHub releases.
module/private_key
**/private_key

# Device evidence is generated output. Whole bundle directories are ignored so
# a soak/repro run does not clutter the tree with untracked files: soak and
# repro snapshots, raw logcat, app dumps, the bisect ladder's build scratch and
# the duck detector reports. Bundles tracked before this rule stay tracked, and
# `git add -f diag/<bundle>/<file>` still keeps a run whose evidence matters.
diag/*/
